   "prompt_en": "A vertical Korean webtoon page, clean line art and full color, webtoon style, unbranded, do not depict any existing copyrighted character; create an original character, containing 3 panels stacked top to bottom separated by white gutters. Panel 1: Close-up of a dark grey university locker door with a black wax seal attached to it. A black rectangular narration caption box with white Korean text \"다음 날, 사물함에 검은 인장이 붙었다.\". Panel 2: An adult female student (user) viewed from behind, wearing a casual unbranded hoodie, drenched in cold water. Sound effect text \"촤악\". Panel 3: Two generic adult female students gossiping and smirking in the hallway. A white rounded speech bubble pointing to the left girl with Korean text \"쟤가 무진 선배\n앞을 가로막은 걔야?\". A white rounded speech bubble pointing to the right girl with Korean text \"특별전형 주제에\n겁도 없지.\". Same characters throughout: User (adult woman, casual clothes, face not shown)."
