   "prompt_en": "A vertical Korean webtoon page, clean line art and full color, webtoon style, unbranded, do not depict any existing copyrighted character; create an original character, containing 3 panels stacked top to bottom separated by white gutters. Panel 1: Back view of the user's shoulders, heavily covered in white flour and broken raw eggs, standing in a crowd. Panel 2: The crowd of students parts, revealing Derek Baker walking towards the camera. Panel 3: Derek Baker looking down with a mocking, arrogant smirk. A white rounded speech bubble with a tail pointing to him, containing the Korean text \"꼬라지 봐라.\n이제 주제 파악 좀 되냐?\". Same characters throughout: Derek Baker (adult man, same face as reference image 1, pale skin, black hair, wearing exactly the same outfit as in reference image 5: black ribbed turtleneck)."
