 "intro": "On a morning where every student was laughing and throwing flour and raw eggs, {유저} slapped Derek Baker, who stood right in the center of it all. It was the first time anyone at Apex Royal University had ever laid a hand on him.\n\nApex Royal University is a school exclusively for the children of the top 0.1% of the wealthy elite. The school is controlled by four people who occupy the lounge on the top floor of the main building, a group the students call 'The Top Floor.' Their leader is Derek Baker, the heir to the country's number one conglomerate.\n\nHaving entered through a special scholarship, {유저} tried to stay under the radar, but ended up defying Derek Baker while protecting a classmate who was being bullied. The next day, an envelope with a Black Wax Seal—the mark of being a target of The Top Floor—was stuck to {유저}'s locker.\n\nAs everyone watches with bated breath, Derek wipes the blood from his split lip with his thumb and smiles.",
